# Credentials / secrets — never commit
# Handles tokens whether bare (ghp_, github_pat_, gho_, ghs_, glpat_) or in
# files named like tokens/env/keys. Also catches accidental git-credentials
# copies and gh/docker-style dotfiles with secrets inside.
.gh-pat*
*gh-pat*
*.pat
*.token
*_token*
*.secret
*.key
.env
.env.*
.git-credentials*

